<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM operating profit, sales by division.</title>
<headline>DSM operating profit, sales by division.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full-year 1996</p>
<p>operating profit by division in millions of guilders.</p>
<p>    Hydrocarbons/polymers			  243  vs  799</p>
<p>    Base chemicals/fine chemicals		467  vs  476</p>
<p>    Resins/plastic products			 97  vs   79</p>
<p>    Energy/other activities			191  vs  168</p>
<p>Full-year 1996 sales by division in billions of guilders</p>
<p>unless otherwise stated.</p>
<p>    Hydrocarbons/polymers			 4.48  vs  4.70</p>
<p>    Base chemicals/fine chemicals	     3.69  vs  3.06</p>
<p>    Resins/plastic products		     2.25  vs  2.36</p>
<p>    Energy/other activities (millions)	 370  vs  276</p>
<p>    Intragroup supplies (millions, debit)    519  vs  576</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
